    description: Some("A fixed shooter in the Galaxian mould. Your ship is pinned to the bottom of the screen while an alien mother ship hangs overhead, steadily sending down three smaller craft that swoop and fire at you. You shoot upward to pick them off — and eventually the mother ship itself — while keeping their shots from reaching the bottom of the screen."),
